ited to his ex-wife's inauguration gala. Banks and O'Doyle must undergo a job evaluation at a fully-immersive offsite facility.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x9mQZ8bFhbEZrqDw5iRh7xo7fsj.jpg","released":"2026-08-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"},{"id":"tt37692332:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Purchase","overview":"After finding an addendum on the Louisiana Purchase receipt, Curtis must race against old enemies and friends to hold control of the territory.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3q5zj2cv3mhCHZVSsMOayai7n6m.jpg","released":"2026-08-16T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"22 min"},{"id":"tt37692332:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"David","overview":"After butting heads with his own Party, Curtis visits Camp David to undergo a true test of his Presidential prowess.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mOV7kerRX8EnpkJly1RswN0g6EE.jpg","released":"2026-08-23T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"22 min"},{"id":"tt37692332:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Hollow","overview":"When America faces a national energy crisis, Curtis and his team venture deep into Hollow Earth to find a solution.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sCobPpydoB9AXIW95tRvzCiDzc5.jpg","released":"2026-08-30T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"},{"id":"tt37692332:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Ghosts","overview":"Banks gets malware, and O'Doyle enters her brain to find a fix. Curtis gives the ghost of Lincoln a gift that lets him settle his unfinished business.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fdmpD1672kKbE7RsWVW7J8kPwVA.jpg","released":"2026-09-06T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"},{"id":"tt37692332:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Knox","overview":"A robbery at Fort Knox puts Curtis and the FBI on a manhunt for the culprit, forcing O'Doyle to confront figures from his past.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eCzLBCcTS0ZPjAgCIOqhRVPBfGx.jpg","released":"2026-09-13T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"},{"id":"tt37692332:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"Synths","overview":"With Christmas spirit at an all-time low, Curtis attempts to find a fix by deploying a group of synthetic beings, custom-designed to spread cheer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kCg7ygwQkHMR3LVmiDJJZqBYrmW.jpg","released":"2026-09-20T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"},{"id":"tt37692332:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"Timber","overview":"When a murderous American legend resurfaces, Curtis rises to the challenge -- but doing so proves to be the ultimate test of his public image.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aUGKzVgRx54M0bD89Y04jouC2L6.jpg","released":"2026-09-27T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"}]}}